        "TileImage": "$($repository 2469b1be-9b06-41d2-94e5-744ef0761da4).Image",
        "Description": "Agents,\r\rthere has been a considerable rise in gang activity around the Club Hölle establishment. It seems someone has infiltrated the ranks of local workers and security. It is not quite clear what their goal is but we should let them know we are aware of the situation to disparage further escalation. Also you need to get your hands on one of the perpetrators outfits. If we can identify the tailor refitting these, we might find the base of this operation.\r\rGood Luck Agents.\rCelllie",
